{"words": [{"text": "أَيَوَدُّ", "translation": "Would like"}, {"text": "أَحَدُكُمْ", "translation": "any of you"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَكُونَ", "translation": "it be"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "جَنَّةٌۭ", "translation": "a garden"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "نَّخِيلٍۢ", "translation": "date-palms"}, {"text": "وَأَعْنَابٍۢ", "translation": "and grapevines"}, {"text": "تَجْرِى", "translation": "flowing"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "[from]"}, {"text": "تَحْتِهَا", "translation": "underneath it"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ", "translation": "the rivers"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "translation": "all (kinds)"}, {"text": "ٱلثَّمَرَٰتِ", "translation": "(of) [the] fruits"}, {"text": "وَأَصَابَهُ", "translation": "and strikes him"}, {"text": "ٱلْكِبَرُ", "translation": "[the] old age"}, {"text": "وَلَهُۥ", "translation": "and [for] his"}, {"text": "ذُرِّيَّةٌۭ", "translation": "children"}, {"text": "ضُعَفَآءُ", "translation": "(are) weak"}, {"text": "فَأَصَابَهَآ", "translation": "then falls on it"}, {"text": "إِعْصَارٌۭ", "translation": "whirlwind"}, {"text": "فِيهِ", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "نَارٌۭ", "translation": "(is) fire"}, {"text": "فَٱحْتَرَقَتْ ۗ", "translation": "then it is burnt"}, {"text": "كَذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "Thus"}, {"text": "يُبَيِّنُ", "translation": "makes clear"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "لَكُمُ", "translation": "for you"}, {"text": "ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ", "translation": "(His) Signs"}, {"text": "لَعَلَّكُمْ", "translation": "so that you may"}, {"text": "تَتَفَكَّرُونَ", "translation": "ponder"}], "sahih": "Would one of you like to have a garden of palm trees and grapevines underneath which rivers flow in which he has from every fruit? But he is afflicted with old age and has weak [i.e., immature] offspring, and it is hit by a whirlwind containing fire and is burned. Thus does Allāh make clear to you [His] verses that you might give thought."}